            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yDAVJ",
              "name": "Lead",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 820,
              "content": "Built only from the app's own colours. A colour always names something — a kind of record, a part of the app, or a status. Everything else stays calm and neutral, and green is kept for the main action.",
