              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Some buttons work like a light switch: Unscheduled, Map and Filters on the Schedule stay on while their panel is open (Filters also stays on while a filter is set). Three ways to show \"on\". In each bar, Unscheduled and Filters are on and Map is off, so you can compare.",
